    Assert.IsNotNull(result);
    Assert.AreEqual("StandardProcessed", result.Status);
}
```
**Risk if unfixed:** False confidence — the test always passes regardless of correctness, inflating coverage.

---

#### 3. Sleepy Test
**File:** `OrderProcessorTests.cs` · **Method:** `ProcessOrder_AsyncNotification_IsSent` (line 91)

```csharp
